/github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102408#issuecomment-2634142031","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102408","id":2634142031,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dAdFP","user":{"login":"rethyria","id":128059044,"node_id":"U_kgDOB6IGpA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128059044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rethyria","html_url":"https://github.com/rethyria","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rethyria/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rethyria/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rethyria/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rethyria/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rethyria/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rethyria/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rethyria/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rethyria/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rethyria/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T14:32:22Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T14:32:22Z","body":"> `PROPERTY_USAGE_NONE` is `0`, meaning it's not a separate bit flag but rather noflags at all. So instead of bitwise OR-ing it (`property.usage |= PROPERTY_USAGE_NONE`) you'd rather need to assign it directly (`property.usage = PROPERTY_USAGE_NONE`)(AND-ing would work too: `property.usage &= PROPERTY_USAGE_NONE`),\n\nI see, thank you! I got the original code from the [docs example](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_object.html#class-object-private-method-validate-property) - a lesson for me not to just copy and paste.\n\nI've tried it following your comment and it works as expected.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2634142031/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":